Extend the CSS fix at the end of the <style> block in /app/frontend/public/inscricao.html to also neutralise .blocoPadrao inside the concurso info area. Suggested addition:
#TopoInformacoes .blocoPadrao, #pgInformacoes .blocoPadrao { border:0 !important; outline:0 !important; box-shadow:none !important; background:transparent !important; }
Alternatively, if .blocoPadrao is an empty spacer element not needed here, hide it: #TopoInformacoes .blocoPadrao { display:none !important; }.
